Default account CSV lists names without detail fields.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight accounts --format csv

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  10 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

account
Assets:Cash
Equity:Opening

========== WARNINGS ==========
